extends ../layout/page.pug

block vars
  - var page = { title: "What's new · Qot. games", description: "New games and changes to Qot. games.", path: "/updates" }

block main
  main
    h1.page-title What’s new
    .prose
      p New games and changes to the old ones. The newest are at the top.
      h2 October 2026
      ul.log
        li
          b Fuse 0xAC is out
          | A puzzle game about guarding one number: check the packets, decode the hex and keep 172 locked. 
          a(href="/games/fuse") Read about Fuse 0xAC
          | .
        li
          b Tessera moves to qot.nz
          | The grid territory game now lives at tessera.qot.nz, with online games that keep running for days. 
          a(href="/games/tessera") Read about Tessera
          | .
        li
          b Egg Hunt is out
          | An Easter egg hunt in a Kiwi autumn garden, the third of the co-op seasonal games. 
          a(href="/games/egg-hunt") Read about Egg Hunt
          | .
        li
          b Summer Santa is out
          | Santa’s Christmas Eve round from the North Pole to a Kiwi summer, built on the same street as Trick or Treat. 
          a(href="/games/summer-santa") Read about Summer Santa
          | .
        li
          b Trick or Treat is out
          | A co-op Halloween game for kids: 19 houses, 19 tricks, and a dress-up shop. 
          a(href="/games/trick-or-treat") Read about Trick or Treat
          | .
        li
          b Juice Factory is out
          | The first Qot. game: a clicker game about squeezing juice from one orange. 
          a(href="/games/juice-factory") Read about Juice Factory
          | .
